BT /F1 10 Tf 54 678 Td (Given a sorted array, determine whether two distinct elements sum to target T.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54 658 Td (APPROACH) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 644 Td (Start one pointer at the beginning and one at the end. If their sum is too small, move) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 631 Td (    the left pointer right; if too large, move the right pointer left.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 54 611 Td (EXAMPLE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 597 Td (A = [1,2,4,6,8], T = 10. The endpoints 1+8=9; move left. Then 2+8=10, so a pair is) Tj ET
